<p>Israel’s parliament passed a law on March 31 making the death penalty the default sentence for some Palestinians convicted of deadly attacks that the law describes as aimed at “ending Israel’s existence”. Multiple sources say the measure would not apply in the same way to Israelis or Jewish extremists accused of similar crimes, prompting criticism that it imposes unequal punishment for similar offenses. The backlash was swift. UN rights chief Volker Türk said enforcing the law would violate Israel’s international obligations and could amount to a war crime, while protests were reported internationally and Israeli human rights groups, along with three lawmakers, asked Israel’s Supreme Court to strike it down.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/mdbLIhI1TbUn3d_BF0tmJGRZqZruoWeIFwNkmoXrWA5BfjqEgkrC3m77MsoYjxA4CY-V2KfoObPcOXsfqJ_UC65tWGln1z-rh8c0KZLmGELW' alt='European Union flags flutter outside the EU Commission headquarters in Brussels, Belgium in this file photo.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Knesset vote: The Knesset approved the measure 62-47, and Prime Minister Benjamin Netanyahu attended the session to cast his vote in favor.</li><li>Chamber celebration: RT said video released by the Knesset showed National Security Minister Itamar Ben-Gvir producing a bottle of alcohol in the chamber as supporters cheered the bill’s passage.</li><li>German stance: Berlin said it could “not endorse” the new law and stressed that rejecting the death penalty is a fundamental principle.</li><li>Palestinian response: The office of Palestinian President Mahmoud Abbas said the measure would not break Palestinian resolve, while the Palestinian Prisoners Club called it openly discriminatory legislation.</li></ul><blockquote>The death penalty bill in Israel is very concerning to us in the EU. This is a clear step backwards — the introduction of the death penalty, together with the discriminatory nature of the law - Anouar El Anouni</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>UN human rights office: Volker Türk said the law is deeply discriminatory, raises serious due process concerns, and should be promptly repealed; if enforced in occupied territory, he said, it would amount to a war crime. (<a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/mar/31/israel-death-penalty-law-international-criticism'>The Guardian</a>)</li><li>Israeli human rights groups: ACRI and other petitioners say the law appears to conflict with Israel’s Basic Laws because it allows arbitrary discrimination. (<a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1987331/eu-condemns-israels-death-penalty-law-close-to-apartheid'>Dawn</a>)</li><li>Spanish government: Prime Minister Pedro Sánchez said the measure means “same crime, different punishment” and called it “a step closer to apartheid.” (<a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1987331/eu-condemns-israels-death-penalty-law-close-to-apartheid'>Dawn</a>)</li><li>Five-country statement: Germany, France, the United Kingdom, Italy, and Australia said they were deeply concerned by what they described as the law’s de facto discriminatory nature. (<a href='https://www.rt.com/news/636891-israeli-death-penalty-palestinians-terrorism/'>RT</a>)</li><li>Israeli government supporters: National Security Minister Itamar Ben-Gvir called the law a day of justice for victims and a deterrent to Israel’s enemies. (<a href='https://www.rt.com/news/636891-israeli-death-penalty-palestinians-terrorism/'>RT</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/shorts/watch-unrwa-and-eu-condemn-israel-death-penalty-law/article70808565.ece'>Watch: UNRWA and EU condemn Israel death penalty law</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/4/1/global-protests-condemning-israels-new-death-penalty-law-for-palestinians'>Global protests condemning Israel’s new death penalty law for Palestinians</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://www.rt.com/news/636891-israeli-death-penalty-palestinians-terrorism/'>Israeli MPs cheer death penalty for Palestinians accused of terrorism (VIDEO)</a> - rt.com</li><li><a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1987331/eu-condemns-israels-death-penalty-law-close-to-apartheid'>EU condemns Israel’s death penalty law ‘close to apartheid’</a> - dawn.com</li><li><a href='https://www.youtube.com/watch'>‘Blatantly racist’: Death penalty law among &#x27;worst legislation&#x27; in Israeli parliamentary history</a> - youtube.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/middle-east/jailed-palestinians-fear-death-by-hanging-without-due-process-under-new-israeli-law'>Jailed Palestinians fear death by hanging without due process under new Israeli law</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://novaramedia.com/2026/03/31/israel-passes-apartheid-death-penalty-for-palestinians/'>Israel Passes APARTHEID Death Penalty for Palestinians</a> - novaramedia.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/mar/31/israel-death-penalty-law-international-criticism'>‘Discriminatory’ Israeli death penalty law would be war crime, says UN rights chief</a> - theguardian.com</li></ul>